    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/furniture-shop-blocks/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Furniture Shop Blocks is a specialized theme designed for furniture stores, home décor shops, interior design businesses, and companies looking to build an elegant and modern home-focused shop presence. It is ideal for showcasing kitchen furniture, living room furniture, bedroom sets, office furniture, custom cabinets, sofas, chairs, tables, wardrobes, and storage solutions with a strong focus on style and functionality. Perfect for promoting kitchen interior design concepts such as L-shaped kitchens, U-shaped kitchens, open-concept layouts, and modular kitchen designs, it allows businesses to present modern, contemporary, rustic, and traditional design styles in a visually appealing way. The theme features high-resolution images, customizable galleries, product carousels, and engaging layouts that highlight kitchen lighting trends like pendant lighting, under-cabinet lighting, and ambient lighting solutions. Its sleek, responsive, and retina-ready structure ensures smooth performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones, delivering a seamless browsing experience for every home décor shop. Built-in sections for banners, testimonials, and product showcases enhance engagement and boost conversions. With WooCommerce integration, businesses can easily manage inventory, display offers, and expand their online shop. Combining elegant design, flexible customization, and strong eCommerce functionality, Furniture Shop Blocks provides a powerful platform for any home and interior design business to grow and succeed online."
    },
